1
00:00:03,194 --> 00:00:08,030
This is the Reports menu of a person whose role has none of these permissions.

2
00:00:08,030 --> 00:00:12,174
It lists the reports they may run, but there is no Report Builder.

3
00:00:13,861 --> 00:00:19,791
In the role, tick Build reports and manage own custom reports and views, and save.

4
00:00:21,351 --> 00:00:26,787
Now the same person has Report Builder under Reports, and builds reports of their own.

5
00:00:26,787 --> 00:00:31,691
They see their own reports, and the ones shared with them, and no one else's.

